      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay i get it. but like is it really that serious? i mean i've eaten those things my whole life and never had a problem. i feel like being too restrictive with my food is just gonna make me feel worse mentally. can't i just moderate the amount or something so it's not a big deal?",
