      "content": "It is a serious interaction, and moderation is not a safe strategy with MAOIs. Those tyramine-rich foods can cause a sudden and potentially life-threatening spike in blood pressure, regardless of how often you've eaten them before. To keep your treatment effective and safe, completely avoiding high-tyramine items is the most prudent course of action. You must follow the dietary restrictions precisely to prevent a medical emergency.",
